      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "我叫西西。我是猫，我一岁了。",
      "traditional": "我叫西西。我是貓，我一歲了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ jiào xī xī wǒ shì māo wǒ yí suì le",
      "english": "My name is Xixi. I’m a cat, and I am one year old. "
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "你看，这是我的家。我的家在日本，这里很漂亮。",
      "traditional": "你看，這是我的家。我的家在日本，這裡很漂亮。",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn zhè shì wǒ de jiā wǒ de jiā zài rì běn zhè lǐ hěn piào liang",
      "english": "Look, this is my home. My home is in Japan. It’s very beautiful here."
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "你看，这是我的妈妈——高小月。她在那儿笑，她很高兴。为什么呢？因为我的爸爸来了！",
      "traditional": "你看，這是我的媽媽——高小月。她在那兒笑，她很高興。為什麼呢？因為我的爸爸來了！",
      "pinyin": "nǐ kàn zhè shì wǒ de mā ma gāo xiǎo yuè tā zài nà'r xiào tā hěn gāo xìng wèi shén me ne yīn wèi wǒ de bà ba lái le",
      "english": "Look, this is my mom—Gao Xiaoyue. She’s smiling over there, she’s very happy. Why? Because my dad has come!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "我的爸爸叫大北，他是我妈妈的男朋友。他住在瑞典，但是今天他来日本了。",
      "traditional": "我的爸爸叫大北，他是我媽媽的男朋友。他住在瑞典，但是今天他來日本了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ de bà ba jiào dà běi tā shì wǒ mā ma de nán péng you tā zhù zài ruì diǎn dàn shì jīn tiān tā lái rì běn le",
      "english": "My dad’s name is Dabei, and he is my mom’s boyfriend. He lives in Sweden, but today he came to Japan."
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "明天是妈妈的生日，他想和我妈妈一起过生日。爸爸看着妈妈，他在笑。",
      "traditional": "明天是媽媽的生日，他想和我媽媽一起過生日。爸爸看著媽媽，他在笑。",
      "pinyin": "míng tiān shì mā ma de shēng rì tā xiǎng hé wǒ mā ma yì qǐ guò shēng rì bà ba kàn zhe mā ma tā zài xiào",
      "english": "Tomorrow is my mom’s birthday, and he wants to celebrate it with my mom. Dad is looking at mom and he is smiling."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "我也在笑，我也很高兴。因为，我见到我爸爸了。",
      "traditional": "我也在笑，我也很高興。因為，我見到我爸爸了。",
      "pinyin": "wǒ yě zài xiào wǒ yě hěn gāo xìng yīn wèi wǒ jiàn dào wǒ bà ba le",
      "english": "I am also smiling. I am also very happy. Because I can see my dad."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": ""
    }
