      "He Has Come",
      "",
      "My name is Xixi. I’m a cat, and I am one year old. ",
      "",
      "Look, this is my home. My home is in Japan. It’s very beautiful here.",
      "",
      "Look, this is my mom—Gao Xiaoyue. She’s smiling over there, she’s very happy. Why? Because my dad has come!",
      "",
      "My dad’s name is Dabei, and he is my mom’s boyfriend. He lives in Sweden, but today he came to Japan.",
      "Tomorrow is my mom’s birthday, and he wants to celebrate it with my mom. Dad is looking at mom and he is smiling.",
      "",
      "I am also smiling. I am also very happy. Because I can see my dad.",
      ""
